{
  "engine": "ngspice",
  "netlist": "front-end.spice",
  "models": {
    "pdk": "ihp-sg13g2",
    "lib": "libs.tech/ngspice/models/cornerMOSlv.lib"
  },
  "corners": {
    "process": [
      "mos_tt"
    ],
    "supply_v": {
      "vsup": [
        1.2
      ]
    },
    "temperature_c": [
      27
    ],
    "params": {
      "pair_w": [
        8e-06,
        8e-06,
        8e-06,
        8e-06,
        8e-06
      ],
      "pair_l": [
        3.4e-07,
        3.4e-07,
        3.4e-07,
        3.4e-07,
        3.4e-07
      ],
      "switch_w": [
        2e-05,
        2e-05,
        2e-05,
        2e-05,
        2e-05
      ],
      "latch_w": [
        6e-06,
        6e-06,
        6e-06,
        6e-06,
        6e-06
      ],
      "load_w": [
        6e-06,
        4e-06,
        8e-06,
        1e-05,
        1.2e-05
      ],
      "dut_ib": [
        1e-05,
        1e-05,
        1e-05,
        1e-05,
        1e-05
      ]
    }
  },
  "analysis": {
    "kind": "noise",
    "args": "v(aop,aon) vd dec 20 1 1e9 1"
  },
  "measurements": [
    {
      "name": "white_out",
      "noise": {
        "quantity": "onoise",
        "at_hz": 1000000.0
      },
      "unit": "V/rtHz"
    },
    {
      "name": "gain_dc",
      "expr": "noise1.onoise_spectrum[0]/noise1.inoise_spectrum[0]",
      "unit": "V/V"
    },
    {
      "name": "xm1a",
      "expr": "noise1.onoise_n.xa.xm1a.nsg13_lv_nmos[120]",
      "unit": "V/rtHz"
    },
    {
      "name": "xm2a",
      "expr": "noise1.onoise_n.xa.xm2a.nsg13_lv_nmos[120]",
      "unit": "V/rtHz"
    },
    {
      "name": "xmta",
      "expr": "noise1.onoise_n.xa.xmta.nsg13_lv_nmos[120]",
      "unit": "V/rtHz"
    },
    {
      "name": "xmswa",
      "expr": "noise1.onoise_n.xa.xmswa.nsg13_lv_nmos[120]",
      "unit": "V/rtHz"
    },
    {
      "name": "xmba",
      "expr": "noise1.onoise_n.xa.xmba.nsg13_lv_nmos[120]",
      "unit": "V/rtHz"
    },
    {
      "name": "xm5a",
      "expr": "noise1.onoise_n.xa.xm5a.nsg13_lv_pmos[120]",
      "unit": "V/rtHz"
    },
    {
      "name": "xm6a",
      "expr": "noise1.onoise_n.xa.xm6a.nsg13_lv_pmos[120]",
      "unit": "V/rtHz"
    }
  ],
  "options": {
    "osdi_preload": [
      "$PDK_ROOT/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/osdi/psp103.osdi",
      "$PDK_ROOT/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/ngspice/osdi/psp103_nqs.osdi"
    ],
    "timeout_s": 30,
    "keep_artifacts": true
  },
  "_comment": [
    "One PVT point (tt / 1.20 V / 27 C). Each zipped parameter row is one issue 498 setting on the archived ib10_sw20lat6 geometry and bias: load_w 6u control first, then the declared candidates 4u, 8u, 10u, 12u. load_w reaches ONLY XM5A/XM6A; latch_w keeps XM3-XM6 of the wrapper at the control's 6u.",
    "The output spectrum and per-device totals are measured at 1 MHz; gain_dc is the magnitude of the differential transfer at 1 Hz. Input-referred density S = white_out / gain_dc (Phase 1 method, reports/20261120-issue477/pvt-batch.md).",
    "For the four-point PVT coverage (tt 27/1.20, sf -40/1.32, ff 125/1.08, fs -40/1.20) derive one request per point exactly as the Phase 1 reproduce block does, and submit with klt sim --batch-set --wait-for-capacity 600."
  ]
}
